name 'pl-ai-101-V2-mod2-understanding-05'
title 'title'
description 'description here'

markdown <<MARKDOWN
<!-- Pitfall 5 -->
<div style="max-width:1000px; margin:0 auto; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial; background:#FFFFFF; padding:32px; color:#292F36; line-height:1.6; font-size:16px;">
<div style="border-radius:18px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(41,47,54,0.08); border:1px solid #e3e6ea;">
<div style="background:#8C52BA; padding:26px;">
<div style="color:#FFFFFF; font-size:26px; font-weight:800;">Pitfall 5: Expecting the AI to Remember or Track Long-Term Context</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#F4F6F8; padding:36px;">
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:32px;">
<div>
<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:24px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(41,47,54,0.04);">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:14px; color:#0093A4;">Scenario</div>
<div style="margin-bottom:18px;">Over several days, Mr. Johnson works with AI to design a 6-week algebra unit. In a new session, he asks:</div>
<div style="background:#F7F8FA; border-left:5px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:14px; padding:18px; margin-bottom:18px;">
<div style="font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#8C52BA; margin-bottom:8px;">Prompt to AI</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:600;">“Can you rewrite the quiz we planned to better support English learners?”</div>
</div>
<div>The AI creates a brand-new quiz unrelated to the unit. Mr. Johnson realizes the model has no memory of their earlier work and has to re-upload the materials.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:24px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(41,47,54,0.04);">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:12px; color:#ED6060;">The Pitfall</div>
<div>Believing AI maintains long-term memory or understands ongoing projects.</div>
</div>
<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:24px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(41,47,54,0.04);">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:12px; color:#0093A4;">Quick Tip</div>
<div style="margin-bottom:18px;">Reintroduce key materials and context whenever you want the AI to build on previous work.</div>
<div style="background:#F7F8FA; border-left:5px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:14px; padding:18px;">
<div style="font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#8C52BA; margin-bottom:8px;">Safer Prompt Example</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:600;">“Here is our unit outline and the original quiz (pasted below). Rewrite the quiz to support English learners while staying aligned to Unit Week 3 objectives. Keep the same skills and difficulty.”</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin-top:32px;">
<details style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; background:#FFFFFF; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(41,47,54,0.04);">
<summary style="cursor:pointer; padding:20px; font-weight:800; font-size:20px; color:#0093A4;">What’s Going on Under the Hood</summary>
<div style="padding:0 20px 20px 20px; border-top:1px solid #F4F6F8;">The AI does not retain memory of past sessions or previous conversations unless context is reintroduced. Each new interaction begins without awareness of prior work. Within a single session, it can reference earlier parts of the conversation, but across sessions it cannot recall materials, plans, or decisions unless they are provided again.</div>
</details>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
MARKDOWN
